  "description": "\"My fake husband has a lover, and that lover is jealous of me. And a mad dog has just appeared, insisting on inserting himself into this fucked-up family tree.\"  \n\n\nA three-year sham marriage initiated to cover up the scandals of a presidential candidate backed by conservatives. Left alone in New York, Korean-American Lee Yu-ri served as her husband Aaron's perfect shield and sanctuary.  \n\n\nShe had planned to step down cleanly and return to a peaceful routine once the election was over, but the moment she stepped into the VVIP room of Aces Department Store, everything fell apart.  \n\n\nLeoluca Casani: an Italian mafia boss reeking of blood and dangerous lust.  \n\n\nWith his rough touch ruthlessly shattering the boundaries of her perfect disguise, Yu-ri's sturdy world begins to melt away in a sticky collapse.  \n\n\n\"The marriage vows you're keeping all by yourself are void. So, get into my bed.\"\n\n[Original Web Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13912060)  \n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5754003847)",
